00:08:02.549 --> 00:08:04.006
Hyper Shadow Sniper 76,

00:08:04.006 --> 00:08:05.379
"When you're performing
chest compressions,

00:08:05.379 --> 00:08:06.329
you break the ribs, right?

00:08:06.329 --> 00:08:08.239
Couldn't that broken rip
puncture an organ below

00:08:08.239 --> 00:08:09.509
