00:08:18.209 --> 00:08:20.369
in the circulatory system
that has some oxygen left,

00:08:20.369 --> 00:08:23.179
you're buying them some
extra added survival type.

00:08:23.179 --> 00:08:24.629
It's why you don't do chest
compressions on people

00:08:24.629 --> 00:08:25.979
who are alive.

00:08:25.979 --> 00:08:28.959
